// Temporary review probe for PR #2143 — mirrors the Windows/Linux
// production round-trip: pick with ProjectFolderSelectorOps →
// pickAndApplyProjectMount persists → app restart → mountedDesktopEnv
// restores. Delete before handing the worktree back.
import 'dart:io';

